WEBVTT

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:17.580
There it is!

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:22.830
"Hotel Mythos"

00:00:57.330 --> 00:00:59.160
Ow, ow!

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:04.080
Ah, I'm fine. Please don't be frightened.

00:01:04.080 --> 00:01:05.950
Thank you.

00:01:05.950 --> 00:01:10.450
You're the one who found this coin, aren't you?

00:02:55.940 --> 00:02:58.440
"Academic Advisor"

00:02:58.440 --> 00:03:01.320
"The AC is broken"

00:03:02.450 --> 00:03:05.580
You're sure you're okay with that, Kagaya?

00:03:05.580 --> 00:03:06.700
Huh?

00:03:06.700 --> 00:03:11.370
Don't you think turning it
down is a bit of a waste?

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:14.080
Your grades are certainly good enough for...

00:03:14.080 --> 00:03:18.290
I think you might be giving me too much credit.

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:23.660
Sorry about that, Kagaya. Well, hmm.

00:03:23.660 --> 00:03:27.410
It'd be a long trip every day, from this town--

00:03:27.410 --> 00:03:31.410
You'd have to find a dorm or something
near the college, and you'd be living alone.

00:03:31.410 --> 00:03:34.410
But don't worry about that.
We can help you work it out.

00:03:34.410 --> 00:03:37.200
Thank you.

00:03:37.200 --> 00:03:41.450
But I'd like to think things over a bit more.

00:03:41.450 --> 00:03:43.580
Oh, okay.

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:46.120
"Gaio University" "Kuroyama Gakuin University"
"Nanyou University" "Nimoku University"
"Oseda University"

00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:50.080
Kagaya, did you find
something you want to pursue?

00:03:52.370 --> 00:03:54.450
Yeah, I guess.

00:03:54.450 --> 00:03:55.790
That's a lie.

00:03:57.200 --> 00:04:02.870
But that's normal, right?

00:04:02.870 --> 00:04:07.330
Well, Kaga? Did you get a recommendation?

00:04:07.330 --> 00:04:09.790
I guess I shouldn't set my sights so high.

00:04:09.790 --> 00:04:12.580
Oh. Well, don't worry about it.

00:04:12.580 --> 00:04:17.160
Professor Kagaya!
Can you show me your work?

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:18.910
Sure. There you go.

00:04:18.910 --> 00:04:20.370
Thank you!

00:04:20.370 --> 00:04:22.910
Ooh!

00:04:22.910 --> 00:04:24.500
What is it, Nana?

00:04:22.910 --> 00:04:26.870
You know his recommendation
was just denied, right?

00:04:24.500 --> 00:04:26.870
Hmm? Oh, nothing.

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:29.500
Who wants to go to college anyway?

00:04:27.950 --> 00:04:29.500
Normal is best.

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:32.200
Being the same as everyone
else makes me feel calm.

00:04:29.500 --> 00:04:32.200
Let's get temp jobs! That's where the fun is!

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:36.450
I don't need to "be myself."

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:34.330
You can polish lenses in factories!

00:04:37.370 --> 00:04:40.620
Ugh, I'm way too tired for gym class.

00:04:40.620 --> 00:04:42.040
We're running a marathon today.

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:46.910
Seriously? It's hot as hell, are they crazy?

00:04:53.750 --> 00:04:55.450
What's up?

00:04:55.450 --> 00:04:57.870
Nothing.

00:04:59.620 --> 00:05:01.870
Just pretend not to see it.

00:05:01.870 --> 00:05:04.790
No need to stick your neck out.

00:05:04.790 --> 00:05:07.120
After all, I'm...

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:14.660
The number you are trying
to reach is no longer in service.

00:05:14.660 --> 00:05:18.540
Please confirm the number and dial again.

00:05:26.450 --> 00:05:28.500
Okay, be back in a bit!

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:29.620
Okay!

00:05:29.620 --> 00:05:32.200
Good luck, Nana!

00:05:33.000 --> 00:05:37.580
I wonder if it got hit by a car
or something. Stupid <i>tanuki</i> .

00:05:37.580 --> 00:05:39.830
Hey, Izumi!

00:05:39.830 --> 00:05:40.660
Your underwear...

00:05:40.660 --> 00:05:42.790
Ugh!

00:05:42.790 --> 00:05:44.790
Kaga, you're looking right at it!

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:46.830
Try to be more subtle, man!

00:05:46.830 --> 00:05:47.660
Huh?!

00:05:47.660 --> 00:05:51.410
Kagaya, you creep!

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:04.080
Her wrist snap on that throw was so sharp...

00:06:04.080 --> 00:06:05.830
Hi there!

00:06:05.830 --> 00:06:07.290
Mifune!

00:06:07.290 --> 00:06:12.450
Hey, did you hear?
I got a college recommendation!

00:06:12.450 --> 00:06:13.700
Oh, congrats--

00:06:13.700 --> 00:06:17.290
To be honest, I didn't think
my chances were great.

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:20.080
Look what my mom said when I told her!

00:06:20.100 --> 00:06:21.860
"Congratulations!"

00:06:22.410 --> 00:06:25.040
Really? That's great.

00:06:25.040 --> 00:06:27.830
Sorry, I'm going to get back to cleaning.

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:32.290
It was supposed to be you, wasn't it?

00:06:32.290 --> 00:06:36.160
The one to get the recommendation.

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:39.410
Why?

00:06:39.410 --> 00:06:43.660
It was your skill that got the recommendation.

00:06:45.370 --> 00:06:47.250
Thank you.

00:06:49.540 --> 00:06:51.830
Oh!

00:06:51.830 --> 00:06:54.910
You've got mud on your pants.
What happened?

00:06:54.910 --> 00:06:57.950
Oh, nothing.

00:07:18.750 --> 00:07:23.330
The truth is, I no longer have
any problems with my vision.

00:07:23.330 --> 00:07:27.290
My eyes just seemed
to get better out of nowhere.

00:07:27.290 --> 00:07:33.040
That's right. My body,
for some reason... At some point...

00:07:38.700 --> 00:07:40.000
A fire?

00:07:40.000 --> 00:07:42.450
And it's close!

00:07:52.450 --> 00:07:54.870
I've got to call 119!

00:07:56.330 --> 00:07:57.830
That smell...

00:07:59.580 --> 00:08:02.660
Is someone... inside?

00:08:07.330 --> 00:08:10.500
No. Don't stick your neck out.

00:08:14.700 --> 00:08:20.700
But... There's a beast inside me!

00:08:22.250 --> 00:08:26.750
I don't know how I got this power.

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:30.250
Why do I have this sense of smell?

00:08:31.910 --> 00:08:34.290
And...

00:08:34.290 --> 00:08:37.540
This strange, monstrous form!

00:08:57.120 --> 00:09:00.040
I just don't understand!

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:04.540
And of all the things I could
transform into, why a stuffed animal?

00:09:04.540 --> 00:09:06.410
Why a dog?

00:09:06.410 --> 00:09:09.040
It's all so crazy...

00:09:10.040 --> 00:09:14.330
Enough. Stay focused, save this person.

00:09:19.000 --> 00:09:22.250
It's hard to move,
and my field of vision is bad.

00:09:22.250 --> 00:09:25.790
No time to mess around.

00:09:26.160 --> 00:09:28.200
Got to hurry.

00:09:41.950 --> 00:09:47.620
What the hell have I become?

00:09:47.620 --> 00:09:51.950
Whatever it is, it allowed me to rescue her.

00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:55.200
"The beast has saved the day!"
Or something like that.

00:09:55.200 --> 00:09:58.660
More like, "the cute mascot has saved the day!"

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:02.410
Well, it was useful this time.
I guess that's okay.

00:10:02.410 --> 00:10:05.040
And nobody saw me.

00:10:22.370 --> 00:10:27.620
What is this? Her smell...

00:10:42.750 --> 00:10:46.660
What am I doing?!

00:11:09.830 --> 00:11:11.330
Our next story--

00:11:11.330 --> 00:11:14.290
This morning, before dawn,
a possible arsonist fire broke out

00:11:14.290 --> 00:11:17.250
at a small industrial garage
in the logging district.

00:11:16.860 --> 00:11:22.280
"Fire at logging building
in the mountains-- Arson?"

00:11:17.250 --> 00:11:20.500
There do not appear to be
any related deaths or injuries.

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:22.410
According to the fire department,

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:29.790
Oh wow, that's pretty close. How scary.

00:11:22.410 --> 00:11:25.410
evidence at the scene indicated
kerosene had been spread around,

00:11:25.410 --> 00:11:29.790
and authorities have begun
investigating a potential arson.

00:11:31.080 --> 00:11:35.120
Why is my phone gone?!

00:11:36.250 --> 00:11:39.500
No way. Did I leave it there?

00:11:43.500 --> 00:11:45.200
What should I do?

00:11:45.200 --> 00:11:49.660
If the cops investigate me,
and my secret gets out...

00:11:47.000 --> 00:11:47.950
Hey!

00:11:47.950 --> 00:11:49.660
Oh, hi!

00:11:54.750 --> 00:11:56.540
That smell...

00:11:58.200 --> 00:12:00.580
Shuichi Kagaya.

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:04.910
This is your phone, isn't it?

00:12:06.950 --> 00:12:09.700
I knew you were out there.

00:12:09.700 --> 00:12:16.410
Nobody believed me. I thought I might be crazy.

00:12:16.410 --> 00:12:21.500
I can't believe you were hiding right here.

00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:23.540
Mind if I ask you some questions?

00:12:23.540 --> 00:12:26.250
I can't help but be curious...

00:12:26.250 --> 00:12:30.370
...about a monster like you.

00:12:49.700 --> 00:12:52.290
Her smell...

00:12:59.580 --> 00:13:02.660
No, stay focused!

00:13:02.660 --> 00:13:05.700
I've got to get my phone back!

00:13:12.120 --> 00:13:14.000
It's not here.

00:13:39.500 --> 00:13:42.080
There you are, monster.

00:13:44.160 --> 00:13:48.370
I was hoping that if everyone
found out who you really are,

00:13:48.370 --> 00:13:50.700
you might go on a rampage here at school.

00:13:50.700 --> 00:13:53.080
I'm a little disappointed.

00:13:53.080 --> 00:13:56.200
Thank you for picking up my phone.

00:13:56.200 --> 00:13:58.080
Huh. You sound so sincere.

00:13:58.080 --> 00:14:02.370
But what exactly do you mean by "monster"?

00:14:04.950 --> 00:14:08.580
Even if she saw me in my transformed state,

00:14:08.580 --> 00:14:13.290
there's no proof that that was me.

00:14:13.290 --> 00:14:19.040
And think about the state she was in.
She probably wasn't fully conscious.

00:14:19.910 --> 00:14:23.040
Maybe if I pretend she was hallucinating...

00:14:24.290 --> 00:14:28.370
Like I asked this morning,
did you see something?

00:14:31.040 --> 00:14:38.700
Oh! I guess I've made a mistake.
Here's your phone.

00:14:40.950 --> 00:14:43.120
Still, it's strange.

00:14:43.120 --> 00:14:46.120
I could have sworn I saw it.

00:14:46.120 --> 00:14:49.370
A monster that almost violated me.

00:15:12.660 --> 00:15:16.330
Smile for the camera!

00:15:18.370 --> 00:15:20.910
That's a good one.

00:15:26.750 --> 00:15:32.330
Hmm. You're more handsome in this form.

00:15:33.160 --> 00:15:37.790
You don't mind standing out here in plain sight?

00:15:39.790 --> 00:15:43.160
What happened, Nana?

00:15:43.160 --> 00:15:46.200
Did I just imagine that?

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:52.500
Is this a real gun?

00:15:52.500 --> 00:15:57.200
I don't know! I think it's a toy.

00:15:57.200 --> 00:15:59.830
That's enough! If someone sees me...

00:15:59.830 --> 00:16:04.580
Sorry. Not until you tell me about this form.

00:16:07.580 --> 00:16:12.660
If you don't, I'll tell
everyone that you're a monster.

00:16:14.160 --> 00:16:16.290
Wouldn't that be fun?

00:16:16.290 --> 00:16:22.500
How will people react if
they find out monsters are real?

00:16:22.500 --> 00:16:26.700
You might be famous, get to be on TV.

00:16:26.700 --> 00:16:34.500
Or you might get sliced up like a lab rat.

00:16:35.410 --> 00:16:37.080
Probably that one.

00:16:37.080 --> 00:16:42.790
You'll be left alive,
swarmed over like some kind of toy.

00:16:42.790 --> 00:16:49.160
I don't know anything! Really. Nothing!

00:16:49.160 --> 00:16:52.540
It just started out of nowhere.
The transforming.

00:16:52.540 --> 00:16:55.870
I have no idea what it is!

00:16:58.000 --> 00:17:05.580
Fine then. But if you're lying,
I'll be very upset.

00:17:13.790 --> 00:17:18.080
Why did this happen?

00:17:19.040 --> 00:17:23.080
Oh, I just realized I haven't introduced myself.

00:17:25.410 --> 00:17:28.910
My name is Clair Aoki.

00:17:28.910 --> 00:17:32.950
What a trashy-- I mean, what a fancy name.

00:17:32.950 --> 00:17:34.620
I'm a first year.

00:17:34.620 --> 00:17:37.040
She's younger than me? And by two years!

00:17:37.040 --> 00:17:38.620
What's with that face?

00:17:38.620 --> 00:17:40.370
Oh, nothing!

00:17:40.370 --> 00:17:41.700
By the way, Shuichi...

00:17:41.700 --> 00:17:43.290
Isn't it a little soon to use my first name?!

00:17:43.290 --> 00:17:45.700
Do you know what this is?

00:17:45.700 --> 00:17:49.370
No, I've never seen it. Is it a coin?

00:17:49.370 --> 00:17:54.410
It seems to be related
to you monsters somehow...

00:17:54.410 --> 00:17:55.660
"You monsters"?

00:17:55.660 --> 00:17:57.410
If you don't know, that's fine.

00:17:58.580 --> 00:18:00.410
Hang on a sec!

00:18:03.200 --> 00:18:07.040
Don't just stand there. Let's go.

00:18:11.950 --> 00:18:14.750
Come on in. This is my place.

00:18:14.750 --> 00:18:18.870
Make yourself at home.
I'm the only one who lives here.

00:18:19.120 --> 00:18:22.870
Ah, it was so hot out there. I hate summer.

00:18:22.870 --> 00:18:26.450
All the bugs... And if you're
not careful, you get sunburned.

00:18:28.250 --> 00:18:33.830
This is my first time in a girl's room.
Or, I mean, home!

00:18:40.000 --> 00:18:41.700
Hold on, what are you doing?

00:18:41.700 --> 00:18:44.700
Changing, obviously.

00:18:44.700 --> 00:18:45.870
Changing...?

00:18:45.870 --> 00:18:48.330
All that stress made me sweat.

00:18:48.330 --> 00:18:51.750
Is she one of those nudists?!

00:18:51.750 --> 00:18:55.040
No, she still has her underwear on...

00:18:56.410 --> 00:18:58.950
Nevermind!

00:19:02.790 --> 00:19:04.620
It's nothing to be embarrassed about.

00:19:04.620 --> 00:19:07.450
Completely unavoidable in a situation like this.

00:19:07.450 --> 00:19:13.200
A perfectly natural biological
reaction for a mature male.

00:19:13.200 --> 00:19:16.580
Be a good boy and wait there.

00:19:16.580 --> 00:19:19.290
If you move, I'll kill you.

00:19:19.950 --> 00:19:25.250
Don't forget, you've got to do as I say now.

00:19:25.250 --> 00:19:28.080
I saved you, remember?

00:19:28.080 --> 00:19:31.370
If it wasn't for me, you'd have died!

00:19:31.370 --> 00:19:32.080
I'm your--

00:19:32.080 --> 00:19:34.410
That's right.

00:19:34.410 --> 00:19:39.000
You completely ruined my suicide.

00:19:40.950 --> 00:19:47.370
Like I said, nobody believed me
when I told them monsters are real.

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:50.000
But I finally found one.

00:19:50.000 --> 00:19:53.330
Clair, what are you...?

00:19:53.330 --> 00:19:57.000
You'll help me, won't you, Shuichi?

00:20:00.540 --> 00:20:02.370
Do you know them?

00:20:02.370 --> 00:20:04.370
Nope.

00:20:07.540 --> 00:20:09.540
Shuichi, they're an enemy!

00:20:09.540 --> 00:20:10.660
Enemy?

00:20:18.790 --> 00:20:23.040
Who the hell are you? Barging in like that--

00:20:23.040 --> 00:20:25.290
Give me the coin.

00:20:25.290 --> 00:20:29.040
Coin... You mean this?

00:20:29.830 --> 00:20:35.580
I see. You want it, so you must know what it is.

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:36.660
Psh.

00:20:36.660 --> 00:20:41.160
Maybe you'd like to share.
What the hell is this thing?

00:20:42.370 --> 00:20:44.290
The coin...

00:20:49.790 --> 00:20:53.580
In exchange for power, you lose everything.

00:20:56.950 --> 00:20:59.080
Give me the coin.

00:21:02.790 --> 00:21:06.790
Don't kill her now, Shuichi.
I've got some questions for her.

00:21:06.790 --> 00:21:10.700
Of course I'm not going to kill her!
Why would I do that?!

00:21:10.700 --> 00:21:12.450
Hold still!

00:21:12.450 --> 00:21:20.200
Let's take a step back here.
Why don't you introduce yourself?

00:21:21.540 --> 00:21:25.870
Come on, out with it. What's your name?

00:21:27.120 --> 00:21:31.700
Oh, I get it. You guys are gatherers, too.

00:21:33.620 --> 00:21:36.450
I guess I don't need this, then.

00:21:37.620 --> 00:21:40.910
I don't care who comes for me...

00:21:42.160 --> 00:21:44.910
Or how many of you there are...

00:21:45.870 --> 00:21:49.450
I'll rip you apart!

00:21:56.660 --> 00:21:59.450
You're... like me...

00:22:02.000 --> 00:22:03.580
A monster.

00:22:05.250 --> 00:22:06.950
Pathetic!

00:23:44.190 --> 00:23:47.030
"Episode 2: What It Means to Be Empty"
